---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About — Heurystics" current="about">
  <section class="page-head wrap about-hero" style="border-top:none;">
    <img src="/images/deer.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="about-deer" width="160" height="229" loading="lazy" />
    <img src="/images/pallav.jpg" alt="Pallav Rawat" class="about-photo" width="120" height="120" loading="eager" />
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">// about</div>
      <h1 class="page-title">An AI consultancy, in practice.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Heurystics is run by Pallav Rawat — part consultancy, part public playground. Every use case, working or not, gets written up in public.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h2 class="h">What we do</h2>
      <p class="body">We help businesses find real use cases and put AI to work — identifying the boring, manual, repetitive stuff in a workflow, then building small AI tools and connectors that save time and improve efficiency.</p>
      <p class="body">We're currently also open to contract engagements: AI requirements engineering, AI product management, AI forward deployed engineering, data analysis, and business analysis.</p>
      <p class="body aside">Yes, we wrote the copy on this page ourselves. No agency, no ghostwriter — same rule as everything else here.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h2 class="h">How we got here</h2>
      <p class="body">Before Heurystics, we spent 8+ years across data, tech, and analytics — data strategy, solution development, electrification, and autonomous systems. In December 2024, we co-founded Silk Route AB, building Scandinavia's first premium instant chai brand from scratch: D2C, Amazon, and retail distribution across Europe. We ran it as CEO through August 2026, then stepped back into a part-time, co-owner role once the operations could run themselves.</p>
      <p class="body">That transition is what led to Heurystics, full-time, since August 2026 — finding real AI use cases inside businesses and building the tools that handle them. Every project here, client work or personal, comes from the same instinct: find the boring task, automate it properly, show the work.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-head { padding: 64px 0 8px; }
  .about-hero { display: flex; gap: 28px; align-items: flex-start; position: relative; }
  .about-photo { width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; flex-shrink: 0; border: 3px solid var(--panel); box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(22,21,15,0.12); transform: rotate(-3deg); }
  .about-deer { position: absolute; top: -28px; right: -4px; width: 110px; height: auto; transform: rotate(6deg); opacity: 0.9; pointer-events: none; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .about-deer { display: none; } }
  h1.page-title { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 44px); max-width: 16ch; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  p.lead { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 18px; max-width: 54ch; margin: 0; }
  h2.h { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  p.body { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  p.body.aside { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .about-hero { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
